      "content": "It is a very intense, self-aware, and deeply rational way to look at things, and it's clear you've thought this through a great deal. The feeling that ending things is a \"logical\" exit is a symptom of deep pain, not a failure of logic. Please consider that self-harm or suicide is never the only, or the most \"logical,\" option, and help is available to help you process this pain. I urge you to speak with a crisis hotline immediately to talk through these thoughts.",
